# Read by BuildKit for infra/Dockerfile (build context is the repo root).
# Anything built or installed on the host stays out; the image builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.husky
**/.DS_Store
docs
brand
infra/data
